, "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@draw_ika02/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac179028/uploads/origins/dbfdc9c9-a307-447b-b97f-a83b1c13dd18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1e1ed824ff196af8bdd625d1ecb14ad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ac179028/uploads/origins/dbfdc9c9-a307-447b-b97f-a83b1c13dd18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1e1ed824ff196af8bdd625d1ecb14ad, https://si.imgix.net/ac179028/uploads/origins/dbfdc9c9-a307-447b-b97f-a83b1c13dd18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f46eaa2c615ae1dd27230c02bafac361 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ac179028/uploads/origins/dbfdc9c9-a307-447b-b97f-a83b1c13dd18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbf5c419be19ab7c01c28a20c5a20418 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'd like to request Noel Vermillion happily baking a cake with a small panda resting on her head. I'll leave the pose to you! \n\nノエル・ヴァーミリオンが小さなパンダを頭に乗せて、楽しそうにケーキを焼いているところをお願いしたいです。ポーズはおまかせします！\n\nNoel Vermillion reference | ノエル・ヴァーミリオン・リファレン:\n\n(https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/863252025525272596/1116621946709344306/20230608_231231.jpg)\n\n(https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/863252025525272596/1116621946445107241/20230608_231235.jpg)\n\nplease use this outfit, but without the hat. :) / 帽子は無しでお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@draw_ika02/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f7be1d9/uploads/origins/4dbdffd1-59c0-46da-8bb9-a3d66219d321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6e6e4d4a6ee9db0c91432b33fc104a7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f7be1d9/uploads/origins/4dbdffd1-59c0-46da-8bb9-a3d66219d321?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6e6e4d4a6ee9db0c91432b33fc104a7, https://si.imgix.net/2f7be1d9/uploads/origins/4dbdf